Z||000000||dogtired||02-14-2000||05:50 AM||||Dbase = Memory Hog   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><BR>OK I know there are several parts of dbases out there for out cars and they seem to be doing a great job so far!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>I do not have Computer power, know-how or webpage?   BUT<BR>Was wondering is there any interest in a complete dbase of all known Fieros???? including all info of car and owner???? All cars that have been crushed, whatever??<BR>I also realize we are talking about 370,168 cars!<BR>Just looking for the FORUMs thoughts  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Ideas  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>Volunteers  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><BR>||||reg||6
